msgid "# Installation Guide"
msgstr "# 安装指南"

msgid ""
"This guide helps you prepare the host and software environment so that you "
"can run your first model by following the [Quick Start](quick_start.md)."
msgstr "本指南帮助您准备主机和软件环境，以便您能够按照[快速开始](quick_start.md)运行您的第一个模型。"

