msgstr "    | Triton / Triton Ascend | 不支持 | 面向昇腾平台的Triton实现；310P系列不使用 |"

msgid "???+ important \"Install a compatible software stack\""
msgstr "???+ important \"安装兼容的软件栈\""

msgid ""
"Treat vLLM Ascend, vLLM, PyTorch, TorchNPU, CANN, and Triton Ascend when "
"applicable as one complete compatibility set. When installing a release, "
"select an entire row from the [release compatibility "
"matrix](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-compatibility-matrix). "
"When developing against the main branch, use the exact vLLM commit recorded "
"in `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit`; arbitrary vLLM tags or PyPI releases"
" may have different transitive dependencies."
msgstr ""
"将vLLM Ascend、vLLM、PyTorch、TorchNPU、CANN以及适用的Triton "
"Ascend视为一个完整的兼容性集合。安装发布版本时，请从[发布兼容性矩阵](../community/versioning_policy.md#release-"
"compatibility-matrix)中选择整行。针对主分支进行开发时，请使用`.github/vllm-main-"
"verified.commit`中记录的精确vLLM提交；任意的vLLM标签或PyPI发布版本可能具有不同的传递依赖。"

