msgid "### CPU-only build verification {: #installation-cpu-build }"
msgstr "### 仅CPU构建验证 {: #installation-cpu-build }"

msgid ""
"CPU-only build verification checks whether the Python package can be built "
"without a visible Ascend device. It does not verify NPU runtime loading, "
"inference examples, custom kernels, or NPU-specific tests. The build process"
" needs access to CANN Toolkit headers and libraries, so CANN Toolkit must "
"still be installed."
msgstr ""
"仅CPU构建验证检查Python包是否可以在没有可见昇腾设备的情况下构建。它不验证NPU运行时加载、推理示例、自定义内核或NPU特定测试。构建过程需要访问CANN"
" Toolkit头文件和库，因此仍然必须安装CANN Toolkit。"

msgid ""
"First, install the Python build backend and native build tools. Editable "
"installations use setuptools-scm directly. If no compatible wheel is "
"available, `arctic-inference` also requires CMake and Ninja:"
msgstr ""
"首先，安装Python构建后端和原生构建工具。可编辑安装直接使用setuptools-scm。如果没有可用的兼容wheel，`arctic-"
"inference`还需要CMake和Ninja："

msgid ""
"This workflow verifies only the build and therefore does not install vLLM. "
"To continue testing vLLM and vLLM Ascend together on the main branch, use "
"the exact vLLM commit recorded in `.github/vllm-main-verified.commit` and "
"verify the combined environment as described below."
msgstr ""
"此工作流仅验证构建，因此不会安装vLLM。要继续在主分支上同时测试vLLM和vLLM Ascend，请使用`.github/vllm-main-"
"verified.commit`中记录的精确vLLM提交，并按如下所述验证组合环境。"

msgid ""
"In an x86 environment, install the CPU version of PyTorch from the PyTorch "
"CPU index before installing the remaining Ascend dependencies:"
msgstr "在x86环境中，在安装其余Ascend依赖之前，先从PyTorch CPU索引安装CPU版本的PyTorch："

msgid ""
"Before building vLLM Ascend, explicitly set the build target and disable "
"automatic device backend loading:"
msgstr "在构建vLLM Ascend之前，显式设置构建目标并禁用自动设备后端加载："

msgid "???+ important \"Set the correct SOC_VERSION when no NPU is visible\""
msgstr "???+ important \"当没有可见NPU时，设置正确的SOC_VERSION\""

msgid ""
"If `npu-smi` is unavailable in the current environment, set `SOC_VERSION` "
"for the target hardware before running `pip install -e .`:"
msgstr "如果当前环境中`npu-smi`不可用，请在运行`pip install -e .`之前为目标硬件设置`SOC_VERSION`："

msgid ""
"- A2: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend910b1`\n"
"    - A3: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend910_9391`\n"
"    - 310P: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend310p1`\n"
"    - 950DT: `export SOC_VERSION=ascend950dt_9582`"
msgstr ""
"- A2：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend910b1`\n"
"    - A3：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend910_9391`\n"
"    - 310P：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend310p1`\n"
"    - 950DT：`export SOC_VERSION=ascend950dt_9582`"

msgid "???+ tip \"Enable batch invariance\""
msgstr "???+ tip \"启用批处理不变性\""

msgid ""
"To enable batch invariance, set `VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1` before building "
"vLLM Ascend so that the custom operator library for batch invariance is "
"installed during installation. For usage instructions, see [Batch "
"Invariance](../user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md)."
msgstr ""
"要启用批处理不变性，请在构建vLLM "
"Ascend之前设置`VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1`，以便在安装过程中安装用于批处理不变性的自定义算子库。有关使用说明，请参阅[批处理不变性](../user_guide/feature_guide/batch_invariance.md)。"

msgid ""
"The explicit build dependencies above and `requirements.txt` provide the "
"complete build-system dependencies before the non-isolated editable build "
"starts. `--no-build-isolation` only reuses packages in the current build "
"environment; it cannot make incompatible vLLM, PyTorch, and TorchNPU "
"versions compatible. Before using the environment for actual workloads, run "
"`python -m pip check` and resolve all reported conflicts. If no device is "
"available, skip the inference examples and NPU-specific tests."
msgstr ""
"上述显式构建依赖和`requirements.txt`在非隔离可编辑构建开始之前提供了完整的构建系统依赖。`--no-build-"
"isolation`仅重用当前构建环境中的包；它无法使不兼容的vLLM、PyTorch和TorchNPU版本变得兼容。在将环境用于实际工作负载之前，请运行`python"
" -m pip check`并解决所有报告的冲突。如果没有可用设备，请跳过推理示例和特定于NPU的测试。"

msgid ""
"Building custom operators requires gcc/g++ later than version 8 and C++17 or"
" later. If you encounter a TorchNPU version conflict when running `pip "
"install -e .`, use `pip install --no-build-isolation -e .` instead to build "
"in the system environment."
msgstr ""
"构建自定义算子需要gcc/g++版本高于8，且需要C++17或更高版本。如果在运行`pip install -e "
".`时遇到TorchNPU版本冲突，请改用`pip install --no-build-isolation -e .`在系统环境中构建。"

msgid ""
"If you encounter other compilation issues, an unexpected compiler may be in "
"use. Before compiling, set `CXX_COMPILER` and `C_COMPILER` to the locations "
"of g++ and gcc, respectively."
msgstr ""
"如果遇到其他编译问题，可能是因为使用了意外的编译器。在编译之前，请将`CXX_COMPILER`和`C_COMPILER`分别设置为g++和gcc的位置。"

msgid "### Multi-node deployment {: #installation-multi-node }"
msgstr "### 多节点部署 {: #installation-multi-node }"

msgid ""
"Check the physical links, the status of each node, and inter-node "
"connectivity in order."
msgstr "依次检查物理链路、每个节点的状态以及节点间的连通性。"

msgid "#### Physical link requirements {: #installation-multi-node-physical }"
msgstr "#### 物理链路要求 {: #installation-multi-node-physical }"

msgid ""
"- The physical machines must be on the same LAN and able to communicate with each other.\n"
"- All NPUs must be connected through optical modules, and all connections must be healthy."
msgstr ""
"- 物理机器必须位于同一局域网内，并且能够相互通信。\n"
"- 所有NPU必须通过光模块连接，且所有连接必须健康。"

msgid "???+ important \"950DT server precheck\""
msgstr "???+ important \"950DT服务器预检查\""

msgid ""
"This precheck applies only to 950DT servers. Other server series can skip "
"it."
msgstr "此预检查仅适用于950DT服务器。其他服务器系列可以跳过。"

msgid "**Prepare the HiXLEP configuration paths**:"
msgstr "**准备HiXLEP配置路径**："

msgid ""
"- When deploying a 950DT inference service, confirm on each server that "
"`/lib/route.conf`, `/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`, and the `/etc/hixlep` "
"directory that describes the UB link topology exist and are configured "
"correctly. If any item is missing or misconfigured, follow the [HiXLEP "
"configuration file generation "
"guide](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)"
" to generate the required content. Select the \"D2D scenario\" when "
"generating `/etc/hixlep`."
msgstr ""
"- "
"部署950DT推理服务时，请在每台服务器上确认`/lib/route.conf`、`/etc/hccl_rootinfo.json`以及描述UB链路拓扑的`/etc/hixlep`目录存在且配置正确。如果任何项目缺失或配置错误，请按照[HiXLEP配置文件生成指南](https://gitcode.com/cann/hixl/wiki/A5%20LocalCommRes%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md)生成所需内容。生成`/etc/hixlep`时选择\"D2D场景\"。"

